 kit syntax - prints a verb's grammar as JSON, and checks its header

   one of
   *kit syntax*                prints a verb's grammar as JSON, and checks its header

     --check   --list        prints no JSON; names each fault in the header, and fails

     <verb>…                 the verbs to print; none prints every verb

   <verb> --choices <answer>
   <verb> --extend <answer>
   <verb> --match <word>


 kit syntax
